    "confidence": "moderate",
    "plain": "Capping donations to political parties would reduce the outsized influence of wealthy donors over democratic processes, improving equal treatment in access to political power. The size of the improvement depends heavily on where the cap is set \u2014 a high cap changes little, while a low one could substantially rebalance funding.",
    "biggest_unknown": "The cap level is unspecified: a high cap (e.g. \u00a31 million) would do little to disrupt elite influence, while a low cap (e.g. \u00a310,000\u2013\u00a3100,000) could meaningfully democratise party funding.",
